  "limitations": "Original reconstruction against the GameModels3D Dunkerque reference; the four barrels sit on the evenly spaced rig pitch rather than the reference two-pair spacing, the rigid gun-port shrouds are reconstructed as articulated canvas covers on a raised port frame that stands higher than the reference hoods so the bores clear it at full elevation, and the fixed deck sponsons the reference hangs below its sole plane are omitted, as is the 0.18 m of shell skirt the reference hangs into its barbette well. Weapon and armor values are provisional game calibration. Installed clearance requires ship review.",
